msgstr "Développé <a href=\"http://github.com/samuelclay/\">à code source ouvert</a> à New York et à San Francisco."

msgid "Built before Google Reader died, built to last after it"
msgstr "Créé avant la disparition de Google Reader, conçu pour lui survivre"

msgid "Built for iOS<br>from the ground up"
